## Warnings reported to the developer console while processing a Web App
## Manifest. "id", "scope", "start_url" and "src" are manifest member names
## and should not be translated.

dom-manifest-should-be-object = Manifest ਆਬਜੈਕਟ ਹੋਣਾ ਚਾਹੀਦਾ ਹੈ।
dom-manifest-scope-url-invalid = ਸਕੋਪ URL ਗਲਤ ਹੈ।
dom-manifest-scope-not-same-origin = ਸਕੋਪ URL ਦਾ ਮੁੱਢ ਦਸਤਾਵੇਜ਼ ਹੋਣਾ ਚਾਹੀਦਾ ਹੈ।
dom-manifest-start-url-invalid = ਸਕੋਪ URL ਗਲਤ ਹੈ।
# Variables:
#   $property (String) - The name of the property whose value is invalid, e.g. "theme_color".
#   $value (String) - The invalid value of the property.
# Example: "theme_color: 42 is not a valid CSS color."
dom-manifest-invalid-css-color = { $property }: { $value } ਢੁੱਕਵਾਂ CSS ਰੰਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ।
# Variables:
#   $property (String) - The name of the property whose value is invalid, e.g. "lang".
#   $value (String) - The invalid value of the property.
# Example: "lang: 42 is not a valid language code."
dom-manifest-lang-is-invalid = { $property }: { $value } ਵਾਜਬ ਭਾਸ਼ਾ ਕੋਡ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ।
